# Per-tool agent configs generated by `bounds agent --sync`. The canonical contract
# (BOUNDS.md) and the cross-tool AGENTS.md are committed; everything below is a regenerable,
# tool-specific projection — kept out of the repo so a clone stays lean. Run `bounds agent --sync`
# locally to (re)create them for your editor/agent.
.claude/commands/bounds.md
.cursor/rules/bounds.mdc
.windsurf/rules/bounds.md
.aider.conf.yml
.github/copilot-instructions.md
GEMINI.md

# CI config generated by `bounds ci --install` in a *consuming* project — not committed
# in the framework repo (these belong in the user's project, not here).
# (No-op here since the framework repo doesn't self-install its own gate; listed for clarity.)

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
